[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5538626387","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123177#issuecomment-5538626387","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123177","id":5538626387,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSiC7Uw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T09:40:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T09:40:51Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n