026-09-30T20:06:08Z","body":"Ran into this as well. Can confirm that *something* is consistently going wrong with skybox orientation and LightmapGI in 4.4.1, 4.6.3, and 4.8dev6.\n\nThe top sphere is realtime-only, the bottom sphere is baked with LightmapGI.\n\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/800fb09a-e701-4006-ad4f-ab8fd2d45ed2\" />\n\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fe318cd-2eaf-4259-bd91-5a2d6a4c7338\" />\n\nMRP below. Keep in mind that by default the editor directional light will be on, it has to be disabled to accurately view the scene with only the sky lighting. Run the project to recreate the camera position/screenshots in this post.\n\n[baked-gi-direction-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32875154/baked-gi-direction-test.zip)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5918750622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5919139909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123177#issuecomment-5919139909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123177","id":5919139909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYM7oRQ","user":{"login":"Image-unavailable","id":56268917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjY4OTE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56268917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable","html_url":"https://github.com/Image-unavailable","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Image-unavailable/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T20:27:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T20:27:20Z","body":"Did some more testing, confirmed that the issue is indeed a 180° rotation around the Y axis.\n\nSame as the previous tests, the top sphere is realtime, the bottom one is baked.\n\nThis is a normal bake (see the broken behaviour):\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3741f58e-46fb-48bb-918f-18b1c65a5dc8\" />\n\nThis is a bake where *after* baking the bottom sphere has been rotated 180° around the Y axis (see the correct behaviour):\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcba02ca-49fb-4b19-9b49-f42cd405ebd5\" />\n\nUpdated MRP: [baked-gi-direction-test-improved.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32875970/baked-gi-direction-test-improved.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5919139909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5920330319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123177#issuecomment-5920330319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123177","id":5920330319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYOE